# Vendored USDS reference app — local design reference only. Not imported at
# runtime (design tokens were hand-extracted into src/lib/tokens/). Carries its
# own .git + Vite toolchain, so it is intentionally excluded from this repo to
# keep the shipped Next.js/Payload build clean for Pages demo and host deploy.
vendor/

# Oversized source video — exceeds GitHub's 100 MB hard limit and is not
